<section id="S5.SS1.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">5.1.3 </span>Performance of Image <math id="S5.SS1.SSS3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Text</h4>

<div id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To comprehensively evaluate the capabilities on Image <math id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Text, we compare Qwen2.5-Omni with the recent state-of-the-art large vision language model Qwen2.5-VL-7B and other best-performing omni models. As illustrated in Table <a href="#S5.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 5.1.3 Performance of Image → Text ‣ 5.1 Evaluation of X→Text ‣ 5 Evaluation ‣ Qwen2.5-Omni Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, Qwen2.5-Omni demonstrates comparable performance to Qwen2.5-VL-7B, and attains better results on MMMU, MathVision, MMBench-V1.1-EN, TextVQA, DocVQA and ChartQA than any other open-sourced omni models. Additionally, Qwen2.5-Omni also surpasses GPT-4o-mini on most benchmarks. These results reveal the excellent capability of our model on image understanding.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="S5.T5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Image <math id="S5.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Text performance of 7B+ models and Qwen2.5-Omni</span></figcaption>
<table id="S5.T5.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S5.T5.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T5.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;"><span id="S5.T5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Datasets</span></td>
