<div id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For visual grounding, we compare Qwen2.5-Omni with Qwen2.5-VL-7B and other leading LVLMs including Gemini and Grounding-DINO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib57" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. As illustrated in Table <a href="#S5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 5.1.3 Performance of Image → Text ‣ 5.1 Evaluation of X→Text ‣ 5 Evaluation ‣ Qwen2.5-Omni Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, our model outperforms other models across most benchmarks from box-grounding to point-grounding and achieves a good performance of 42.2mAP on open-vocabulary object detection, which reveals the strong visual grounding capability of our model.</p>
</div>
