<div id="S5.SS1.SSS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#S5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 5.1.5 Performance of Multimodality→Text ‣ 5.1 Evaluation of X→Text ‣ 5 Evaluation ‣ Qwen2.5-Omni Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, Qwen2.5-Omni achieves state-of-the-art performance on OmniBench, surpassing other Omni models by a large margin, which demonstrates the superiority of our model in multimodality understanding.</p>
</div>
